WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Hey guys, I'm here with Adrian.

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.253
We've just completed his roof here in

00:00:03.293 --> 00:00:03.760
Clear Island.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.760
How'd you find everything?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.760
Yeah, really great.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.580
The guys came in with their team

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.400
and were really quick with the demolition

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:10.920
on the first day.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.211
Already noticing a big difference in the

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:14.520
temperature of the house.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.142
It's been really, really good service overall,

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:19.640
so very happy with it.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.640
Thank you.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:21.880
Cheers.
